    "text_1": {
     "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
     "text": "<p>Microchip is a leading supplier of automotive microcontrollers and analog semiconductors, providing low-risk product development, lower total system cost and faster time to market for thousands of diverse customer applications worldwide. Headquartered in Chandler, Arizona, Microchip offers outstanding technical support along with dependable delivery and quality for their Microchip products.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>PIC® Microcontrollers</li>\n<li>Amplifiers &amp; Linear</li>\n<li>Data Converters</li>\n<li>Interface</li>\n<li>Motor Drivers</li>\n<li>Power Management</li>\n<li>Safety &amp; Security</li>\n<li>Thermal Management</li>\n<li>Memory</li>\n<li>Touch and Input Sensing</li>\n<li>Wireless</li>\n<li>Real-Time Clock</li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">For more information regarding Microchip automotive microcontrollers and other Microchip products:</p>",
